/p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"auto\"><strong><br></strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(154, 117, 27);\"><strong>※電平均全年一度約為5.3元，獨立電表，</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(154, 117, 27);\"><strong>代收垃圾費每月為500元另計</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(154, 117, 27);\"><strong>※&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: fuchsia;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><strong><br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>♠&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: black;\"><strong>房東嚴選&nbsp;因為您值得</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>♠</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(153, 51, 0);\"><strong>♪&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: black;\"><strong>交通方便，公車路線多，近捷運西湖站、285巷超熱鬧商圈、內湖科技園區、西湖市場、美麗華、家樂福超市</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(153, 51, 0);\"><strong>♪</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(153, 51, 0);\"><strong>♪&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: black;\"><strong>網路、水都包，房東幫您省很大~&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(153, 51, 0);\"><strong>♪</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(153, 51, 0);\"><strong>♪&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: black;\"><strong>生活機能讚，食衣住行一次滿足~&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(153, 51, 0);\"><strong>♪</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(153, 51, 0);\"><strong>♪&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: black;\"><strong>家具、家電設備都有附，一卡皮箱就可以輕鬆入住囉!!</strong></s